/*
 * mgwarsDll: types, cross-unit globals and prototypes shared by its units
 * (mgwars, mess, score).
 *
 * Generated by gen_skel.py; names are the reference symbol map's. Offsets are GameCube
 * ones from build/mp5-asm/mgwarsDll.
 *
 * The overlay is compiled at -O0 (every access reloads lbl_1_bss_0; a parameter or local used
 * once lives in a stack slot, one used twice or more in r31.. / f31..).
 */

